{
  "plugin": "minimal-morph-eq",
  "format": "format-1",
  "about": "Minimal Audio full XML; parameters/<name> edits mapped_value in physical units. Numeric edits require the verified intervals below. Raw XML attributes are preserved read-only and not duplicated here. Individual endpoint reload evidence is in range-verification.json.",
